{"hymn":"S487","parent":"E1181","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Es mi anhelo conoerte","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—Como nuestra persona","syl":{"n1":"Es","n2":["mi‿an","i"],"n3":["he","m"],"n4":["lo","t"],"n5":["co","i"],"n6":["no","m"],"n7":["er","m"],"n8":["te","t"],"n9":["Co","i"],"n10":["mo","t"],"n11":"mi","n12":["per","i"],"n13":["so","m"],"n14":["na","t"],"n15":"hoy,","n16":"Que","n17":"Tu","n18":["ple","i"],"n19":["ni","m"],"n20":["tud","t"],"n21":["dis","i"],"n22":["fru","m"],"n23":["te","t"],"n24":"En","n25":"mi","n26":["hom","i"],"n27":["bre","t"],"n28":["in","i"],"n29":["te","m"],"n30":["rior.","t"],"n31":"No","n32":["de‿u","i"],"n33":["na","t"],"n35":["ma","i"],"n36":["ne","m"],"n37":["ra‿ex","m"],"n38":["ter","m"],"n39":["na","t"],"n40":"O","n41":"en","n42":["mi‿al","i"],"n44":["ma","t"],"n45":["na","i"],"n46":["tu","m"],"n47":["ral;","t"],"n48":"Mas,","n49":["Se","i"],"n50":["ñor,","t"],"n51":"que‿al","n52":["con","i"],"n54":["tac","m"],"n55":["tar","m"],"n56":["te,","t"],"n57":"Me","n58":["po","i"],"n59":["se","m"],"n61":["as","t"],"n62":"en","n63":["ver","i"],"n64":["dad.","t"],"n65":["E","i"],"n66":["res","t"],"n67":"mi","n68":["Per","i"],"n69":["so","m"],"n70":["na,","t"],"n71":"En","n72":"mi","n73":"ser","n74":"hoy","n75":["mo","i"],"n76":["ras,","t"],"n77":"¡Oh,","n78":["que‿ex","i"],"n79":["pe","m"],"n80":["ri","m"],"n81":["men","m"],"n82":["te","t"],"n83":["siem","i"],"n84":["pre","t"],"n85":["Es","i"],"n86":["ta","t"],"n87":["rea","i"],"n88":["li","m"],"n89":["dad!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Vive el mundo en las tinieblas,","Ocupado en su afán,","Por el alma tan caída","Que controla Satanás.","Éramos así nosotros,","Hasta que vino a reinar","Jesucristo en nuestras vidas,","A quien conocemos ya."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Como errante yo vagaba","En mi alma sin saber","Que mi espíritu anhelaba","Recibir a Dios en él.","Cuando entró Jesús entonces","Hubo un cambio en mi ser;","Hoy mi espíritu es el centro,","Y la habitación de Él."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Cuán glorioso! Mi persona","Hoy es mi espíritu.","Cristo mismo en mí expresa","Su intención y Su virtud.","No el alma engañosa,","Mas espíritu y verdad.","Cristo ahora es mi Persona,","Mi completa realidad."]}]}